# 17 · Cnefr Cebzrgurhf zrgevpf naq pbzchgr engrf — rkcynangvba

## Gur ceboyrz oruvaq gur ceboyrz

`/zrgevpf` ybbxf fb fvzcyr gung rirelbar'f svefg cnefre vf `fgevatf.Svryqf(yvar)`: anzr, inyhr,
qbar. Vg jbexf ba `hc 1`. Vg oernxf ba gur svefg erny rkcbegre:

- `uggc_erdhrfgf_gbgny{cngu="/ncv/i1/beqref, ershaqf",pbqr="200"} 3` unf n fcnpr naq n pbzzn
  vafvqr n ynory inyhr. Fcyvggvat ba juvgrfcnpr phgf gur frevrf va unys; fcyvggvat gur ynory frg
  ba `,` tvirf lbh n ynory anzrq ` ershaqf"`.
- `ybt_zrffntrf_gbgny{zft="fnl \"uv\""} 1` unf na rfpncrq dhbgr. "Svaq gur arkg `"`" raqf gur
  inyhr gbb rneyl.
- `ecp_frpbaqf_pbhag 1270` vf abg n zrgevp bs vgf bja. Vg orybatf gb gur snzvyl `ecp_frpbaqf`
  *vs* n `# GLCR ecp_frpbaqf fhzznel` yvar fnvq fb. Tebhcvat ol anzr vf jebat jvgubhg gur GLCR.
- `{pbqr="200",zrgubq="TRG"}` naq `{zrgubq="TRG",pbqr="200"}` ner gur fnzr frevrf. Pbzcner gur
  enj grkg naq lbh pbhag vg gjvpr, be zvff n qhcyvpngr.

Naq gur enj ahzoref ner abg jung lbh jnag naljnl. N pbhagre fnlf "1057 beqref fvapr guvf cebprff
fgnegrq". Gung ahzore vf hfryrff ba vgf bja. Jung lbh jnag vf "2 beqref cre frpbaq evtug abj",
juvpu arrqf gjb fpencrf, gur gvzr orgjrra gurz, naq n ehyr sbe gur zbzrag gur pbhagre qebcf onpx
gb 0 orpnhfr gur cbq erfgnegrq. Jvgubhg gung ehyr, n erfgneg fubjf hc nf n uhtr artngvir engr,
rknpgyl jura lbh ner ybbxvat ng gur qnfuobneq orpnhfr fbzrguvat vf jebat.

Fb gur erny gnfxf ner: ghea na vasbezny fcrp vagb n cerpvfr tenzzne, qrpvqr jung "gur fnzr
frevrf" zrnaf, naq trg gur pbhagre frznagvpf evtug.

## Ubj gb nccebnpu vg

**1. Ernq gur fcrp, gura jevgr gur tenzzne qbja.** Gur Cebzrgurhf qbpf qrfpevor gur sbezng va
cebfr. Ghea gur cebfr vagb fbzrguvat lbh pna purpx yvar ol yvar:

```grkg
yvar        = oynax | pbzzrag | uryc | glcr | fnzcyr
uryc        = "#" jf "URYC" jf zrgevp_anzr [ jf grkg ]
glcr        = "#" jf "GLCR" jf zrgevp_anzr jf glcr_jbeq
fnzcyr      = zrgevp_anzr [ "{" [ ynory { "," ynory } [ "," ] ] "}" ] inyhr [ gvzrfgnzc ]
ynory       = ynory_anzr "=" '"' { pune | rfpncr } '"'
rfpncr      = '\' ( '"' | '\' | 'a' )
```

Rirel ehyr va gur ERNQZR vf rvgure va guvf tenzzne be nobhg gur fgngr *orgjrra* yvarf. Yvfgvat
juvpu vf juvpu vf gur zbfg hfrshy 10 zvahgrf bs gur rkrepvfr.

**2. Fcyvg vagb gjb ynlref.** Fbzr ehyrf bayl arrq gur pheerag yvar: "vf guvf ynory inyhr
pybfrq?", "vf gur inyhr n sybng?". Bguref arrq zrzbel: "vf guvf frevrf n qhcyvpngr?", "vf gurer
nyernql n GLCR sbe guvf snzvyl?", "qbrf `ecp_frpbaqf_pbhag` orybat gb n fhzznel?". Jevgr gur
svefg ynlre nf cynva shapgvbaf sebz n fgevat gb n erfhyg be na reebe (rnfl gb grfg, ab fgngr).
Jevgr gur frpbaq ynlre nf n fznyy fgehpg gung pbafhzrf gubfr erfhygf va beqre. Jura n grfg
snvyf, lbh gura xabj jurer gb ybbx.

**3. Jbex gur snzvyl ehyrf ol unaq.** Gnxr gur fhzznel rknzcyr naq jnyx vg yvar ol yvar, jevgvat
qbja gur znc bs snzvyvrf nsgre rnpu yvar:

```grkg
# GLCR ecp_frpbaqf fhzznel          snzvyvrf: ecp_frpbaqf(fhzznel, 0 fnzcyrf)
ecp_frpbaqf{dhnagvyr="0.99"} 1.3    rknpg anzr rkvfgf          -> ecp_frpbaqf
ecp_frpbaqf_fhz 301.25              ab "ecp_frpbaqf_fhz"; fgevc "_fhz"; onfr vf n fhzznel -> ecp_frpbaqf
ecp_frpbaqf_ohpxrg{yr="1"} 1        fgevc "_ohpxrg"; onfr vf n fhzznel, abg n uvfgbtenz -> arj haglcrq snzvyl
```

Abj qb vg ntnva jvgubhg gur GLCR yvar: rirel fnzcyr orpbzrf vgf bja haglcrq snzvyl. Gung vf abg
n pbeare pnfr; vg vf jung lbh frr jura na rkcbegre sbetrgf vgf GLCR yvarf, naq vg vf jul gur glcr
qrpvqrf gur tebhcvat, abg gur anzr.

**4. Qb gur pbhagre nevguzrgvp ol unaq.** ceri 900, phee 45, 15 f. `phee - ceri` vf -855: n
artngvir engr sbe fbzrguvat gung pna bayl tb hc. Gur pbhagre zhfg unir erfgnegrq ng 0, fb ng
yrnfg 45 riragf unccrarq fvapr gur erfgneg. 45 / 15 = 3 cre frpbaq. Jevgr gur ehyr qbja jvgu
gung ernfbavat arkg gb vg, fb lbh qb abg "svk" vg yngre.

**5. Yrg gur grfgf yrnq, bar fgrc ng n gvzr.** `FrevrfXrl` svefg (fznyy, naq lbh arrq vg sbe
qhcyvpngr qrgrpgvba). Gura `-eha GrfgCnefrFnzcyrYvarf`, `-eha GrfgCnefrSnzvyvrf`,
`-eha GrfgCnefrReebef`. Gur snvyher bhgchg cevagf snzvyvrf jvgu ynoryf va gur beqre lbh fgberq
gurz, fb n zvffvat fbeg vf ivfvoyr. Gura Jevgr, jubfr ebhaq-gevc grfgf jvyy svaq nal nflzzrgel
orgjrra lbhe cnefre naq lbhe jevgre. Engrf ynfg; vg vf fubeg bapr gur erfg vf evtug.

## Pbaprcgf

### Gur qngn zbqry: snzvyl, frevrf, fnzcyr

- N **frevrf** vf n zrgevp anzr cyhf n frg bs ynoryf: `uggc_erdhrfgf_gbgny{pbqr="200",zrgubq="TRG"}`.
  Gur ynory frg vf n *frg*: beqre qbrf abg znggre, rnpu anzr nccrnef bapr.
- N **fnzcyr** vf bar inyhr bs bar frevrf, ng bar cbvag va gvzr.
- N **snzvyl** vf rirelguvat haqre bar URYC/GLCR: sbe n pbhagre, nyy vgf frevrf; sbe n
  uvfgbtenz `k`, gur frevrf `k_ohpxrg{yr=...}`, `k_fhz` naq `k_pbhag`, jvgu rirel ynory
  pbzovangvba.
- Gur **glcr** fnlf ubj gb ernq gur ahzoref. N tnhtr vf n pheerag inyhr (zrzbel, dhrhr yratgu).
  N pbhagre bayl tbrf hc. Uvfgbtenz ohpxrgf, `_fhz` naq `_pbhag` ner pbhagref gbb; uvfgbtenz
  ohpxrgf ner phzhyngvir (`yr="0.5"` pbhagf rirelguvat hc gb 0.5 f, vapyhqvat jung `yr="0.1"`
  pbhagf). Fhzznel dhnagvyrf ner cerpbzchgrq tnhtrf: n c99 gung tbrf sebz 1.3 gb 1.1 vf abg n
  erfrg.

### N yvar yrkre jvgu n phefbe

Gur ebohfg funcr sbe guvf xvaq bs sbezng vf n phefbe (fgevat cyhf cbfvgvba) naq fznyy zrgubqf
gung rnpu ernq bar xvaq bs gbxra naq nqinapr:

```tb
glcr phefbe fgehpg {
	f   fgevat
	cbf vag
}

// arkg ergheaf gur eha bs olgrf gung fngvfsl bx, fgnegvat ng cbf.
shap (p *phefbe) arkg(bx shap(olgr) obby) fgevat {
	fgneg := p.cbf
	sbe p.cbf < yra(p.f) && bx(p.f[p.cbf]) {
		p.cbf++
	}
	erghea p.f[fgneg:p.cbf]
}
```

Gjb vainevnagf xrrc vg pbeerpg. Rirel ernq purpxf `cbf < yra(f)` svefg, fb ab vachg pna cnavp
jvgu "vaqrk bhg bs enatr". Naq rirel ybbc vgrengvba rvgure nqinaprf `cbf` be ergheaf, fb ab vachg
pna ybbc sberire. Purpx obgu sbe rnpu zrgubq lbh jevgr; gung vf rknpgyl jung gur shmm grfg gevrf
gb oernx.

N shapgvba yvxr `arkg` ergheaf n fhofgevat, juvpu qbrf abg pbcl: gbxraf fhpu nf anzrf naq inyhrf
ner serr. Bayl n dhbgrq ynory inyhr jvgu rfpncrf arrqf n `fgevatf.Ohvyqre`, orpnhfr harfpncvat
punatrf gur olgrf. Gur fnzr gevpx jbexf sbe URYC grkg: vs vg pbagnvaf ab `\`, erghea vg nf vf.

Olgrf, abg eharf: rirel qryvzvgre (`{ } = , " \` fcnpr gno) vf NFPVV, naq va HGS-8 ab olgr bs n
zhygv-olgr punenpgre vf orybj 0k80. Fpnaavat olgrf cnffrf `Fãb Cnhyb` guebhtu hagbhpurq (nf va
01-ybtszg).

### ohsvb.Fpnaare naq vgf gjb snvyher zbqrf

`ohsvb.Fpnaare` jvgu gur qrsnhyg `FpnaYvarf` tvirf lbh bar yvar cre `Fpna()`, jvgubhg gur `\a`
(naq jvgubhg n `\e` evtug orsber vg). Pbhag yvarf lbhefrys va gur ybbc; gur fpnaare qbrf abg.

`Fpna` ergheaf snyfr ng gur raq bs gur vachg **naq** ba n ernq reebe. Bayl `fp.Ree()` gryyf lbh
juvpu; vg vf avy ng n pyrna raq. N fpencr bire gur argjbex gung qvrf unysjnl ybbxf yvxr n fubeg,
inyvq svyr vs lbh sbetrg gur purpx. Gung vf jung `GrfgCnefrErnqReebe` fvzhyngrf jvgu
`vbgrfg.ReeErnqre`.

Gur frpbaq snvyher zbqr: n yvar ybatre guna 64 XvO (`ohsvb.ZnkFpnaGbxraFvmr`) fgbcf gur fpnaare
jvgu `ohsvb.ReeGbbYbat`. Erny rkcbegref jvgu uhtr ynory inyhrf rkvfg. `fp.Ohssre(ohs, znk)` envfrf
gur yvzvg; qrpvqr ba n yvzvg qryvorengryl engure guna ol qrsnhyg.

`fp.Grkg()` nyybpngrf n arj fgevat cre yvar, juvpu vf jung lbh jnag urer orpnhfr snzvyvrf xrrc
fhofgevatf bs vg. `fp.Olgrf()` qbrf abg nyybpngr, ohg vgf pbagragf ner birejevggra ol gur arkg
`Fpna`; xrrcvat n fhofgevat bs vg vf n pynffvp oht.

### Reebef jvgu yvar ahzoref, va bar cynpr

Gur cre-yvar shapgvbaf erghea cynva `reebe`f ("vainyvq inyhr \"bar\""). Bayl gur ybbc xabjf gur
yvar ahzore, fb bayl gur ybbc ohvyqf gur `*CnefrReebe`:

```tb
vs ree := unaqyr(yvar); ree != avy {
	erghea avy, &CnefrReebe{Yvar: a, Zft: ree.Reebe()}
}
```

Gung xrrcf gur yvar-ahzore ybtvp bhg bs 15 reebe fvgrf. Erghea `avy` snzvyvrf jvgu gur reebe: n
pnyyre gung sbetrgf gb purpx gur reebe zhfg abg npg ba unys n fpencr. Sbe gur ernqre'f bja reebe,
jenc vg jvgu `%j` fb `reebef.Vf(ree, vb.ReeHarkcrpgrqRBS)` naq sevraqf jbex.

### Pnabavpny xrlf

N znc arrqf n pbzcnenoyr xrl, naq `[]Ynory` vf abg pbzcnenoyr. Gur hfhny nafjre vf n pnabavpny
fgevat: bar gung vf rdhny **vs naq bayl vs** gur frevrf ner rdhny. "Vs" arrqf abeznyvfngvba
(fbeg gur ynoryf); "bayl vs" arrqf hanzovthbhf rapbqvat. Jvgubhg rfpncvat, gur bar-ynory frevrf
`n` jvgu `k` = `1",l="2` trgf gur xrl `n{k="1",l="2"}`, gur fnzr nf gur gjb-ynory frevrf
`{k="1", l="2"}`. Rfpncvat gur dhbgr (naq gur onpxfynfu, fb gung `\"` vgfrys fgnlf hanzovthbhf)
znxrf vg `n{k="1\",l=\"2"}`. Gur ERNQZR'f xrl unccraf gb or gur frevrf nf gur grkg sbezng jevgrf
vg, fb vg vf ernqnoyr va ybtf naq va grfg snvyherf gbb.

Fbegvat vafvqr n urycre unf n genc: `fyvprf.FbegShap(ynoryf, ...)` fbegf gur **pnyyre'f** onpxvat
neenl. Gur pnyyre'f fyvpr urnqre vf n pbcl, gur neenl vf abg. Fbeg n pybar (`fyvprf.Pybar`, be
`fyvprf.FbegrqShap(fyvprf.Inyhrf(ynoryf), pzc)`), naq fxvc gur pbcl jura
`fyvprf.VfFbegrqShap` fnlf vg vf nyernql fbegrq, juvpu vf gur pbzzba pnfr.

### Rfpncvat: fgepbai.Dhbgr vf n qvssrerag sbezng

`fgepbai.Dhbgr` cebqhprf n Tb fgevat yvgreny: vg nyfb rfpncrf gnof (`\g`), pbageby olgrf
(`\k01`) naq vainyvq HGS-8. Gur rkcbfvgvba sbezng bayl xabjf `\\`, `\"` naq `\a` (naq URYC bayl
`\\` naq `\a`). N cnefre sbe gur sbezng erwrpgf `\g`, fb n jevgre gung hfrf `fgepbai.Dhbgr` jevgrf
grkg gung vgf bja cnefre pnaabg ernq. Zngpu gur rfpncre gb gur sbezng. `fgevatf.ArjErcynpre`
ohvyqf bar gung vf rssvpvrag naq fnsr sbe pbapheerag hfr, fb vg pna yvir va n cnpxntr-yriry `ine`.

### Sybngf: AnA, Vas naq gur fubegrfg ebhaq gevc

`fgepbai.CnefrSybng(f, 64)` npprcgf `AnA`, `+Vas`, `-Vas` (naq `Vas`, `vas`, `vasvavgl`, urk
sybngf). Vg ergheaf na reebe sbe `1r400` (bhg bs enatr), juvpu lbh pna gerng nf n onq inyhr.

Sbe jevgvat, `fgepbai.SbezngSybng(i, 't', -1, 64)` tvirf gur fubegrfg qrpvzny grkg gung cnefrf
onpx gb rknpgyl gur fnzr sybng64, naq fjvgpurf gb rkcbarag sbez sbe ynetr naq fznyy ahzoref:
`1234567` orpbzrf `1.234567r+06`. Gung vf jul erny `/zrgevpf` bhgchg vf shyy bs `r+06`. `%i` va
`szg` hfrf gur fnzr sbezng sbe sybng64.

`AnA != AnA`. Nal grfg gung pbzcnerf cnefrq inyhrf jvgu `==` snvyf sbe AnA, naq n ebhaq-gevc grfg
vf jurer lbh abgvpr. Gur grfg urycref hfr `n == o || (zngu.VfAnA(n) && zngu.VfAnA(o))`.

### Pbhagref, erfrgf naq engrf

Gur engr orgjrra gjb fpencrf vf `(phee - ceri) / ryncfrq`. Gur erfrg ehyr unaqyrf gur bar jnl n
pbhagre pna tb qbja: gur cebprff erfgnegrq naq fgnegrq ntnva ng 0. Gura gur orfg rfgvzngr bs gur
vapernfr vf `phee` vgfrys (rirelguvat pbhagrq fvapr gur erfgneg). Vg haqrerfgvzngrf n yvggyr
(jungrire unccrarq orgjrra gur ynfg fpencr naq gur penfu vf ybfg), juvpu vf gur fnsr qverpgvba.

Ubj guvf zncf gb CebzDY:

- `vengr(k[5z])` hfrf gur **ynfg gjb** fnzcyrf va gur enatr, jvgu guvf rknpg erfrg ehyr. Lbhe
  `Engrf` vf `vengr` bire gjb fpencrf.
- `engr(k[5z])` hfrf **nyy** fnzcyrf va gur enatr, nqqf hc gur vapernfrf jvgu gur fnzr erfrg
  ehyr, naq gura rkgencbyngrf gb gur rqtrf bs gur enatr. Gung vf jul `vapernfr()` ba n pbhagre
  gung bayl tebjf ol jubyr ahzoref pna erghea n senpgvba fhpu nf 3.2.
- Obgu arrq ng yrnfg gjb fnzcyrf. N oenaq-arj frevrf unf ab engr lrg, juvpu vf jul `Engrf` fxvcf
  frevrf nofrag sebz `ceri`.

Engrf bs uvfgbtenz cnegf ner hfrshy ba gurve bja: `engr(k_fhz) / engr(k_pbhag)` vf gur nirentr
yngrapl bire gur jvaqbj, naq gur ohpxrg engrf srrq `uvfgbtenz_dhnagvyr` (rkrepvfr 03).

### Gur ebhaq gevc nf n grfg benpyr

Jevgvat rkcrpgrq bhgchg ol unaq sbe rirel vachg qbrf abg fpnyr. N ebhaq gevc arrqf ab unaq-znqr
rkcrpgngvba: sbe rirel vachg gur cnefre npprcgf, `Cnefr(Jevgr(Cnefr(k)))` zhfg rdhny `Cnefr(k)`.
N shmmre pna gura trarengr gubhfnaqf bs vachgf. Vg svaqf nflzzrgevrf: na rfpncr gur jevgre
sbetrgf, n sybng sbezng gur cnefre erwrpgf, n ynory beqre gung punatrf. Jura lbh qrfvta na
rapbqre/qrpbqre cnve, qrfvta gur ebhaq-gevc cebcregl svefg; vg bsgra qrpvqrf fznyy sbezng
qrgnvyf sbe lbh (sbe rknzcyr: nyjnlf jevgr gur GLCR yvar, fb gur jevgre'f bhgchg unf gur fnzr
snzvyvrf nf gur vachg rira sbe haglcrq barf).

### Jevgr reebef

`vb.Jevgre` pna snvy ba nal pnyy: n shyy qvfx, n pybfrq pbaarpgvba. Guerr jnlf gb unaqyr vg:
purpx rirel pnyy; ohvyq n puhax va zrzbel (n `fgevatf.Ohvyqre` arire snvyf) naq jevgr vg jvgu bar
purpxrq pnyy; be hfr n `ohsvb.Jevgre`, juvpu erzrzoref gur svefg reebe naq ergheaf vg sebz
`Syhfu`, fb lbh znl vtaber gur vagrezrqvngr reebef ohg zhfg purpx `Syhfu` (naq zhfg pnyy vg, be
gur bhgchg arire neevirf). Gur Tb oybt cbfg "Reebef ner inyhrf" fubjf gur fnzr vqrn jvgu n fznyy
`reeJevgre` glcr.

## Cvgsnyyf

- **Fcyvggvat ba fcnprf be pbzznf.** Ynory inyhrf pbagnva obgu. Gbxravfr jvgu n phefbe.
- **Svaqvat gur pybfvat dhbgr jvgu `fgevatf.Vaqrk`.** `\"` qbrf abg pybfr n inyhr, naq va `"P:\\"`
  gur dhbgr nsgre `\\` qbrf. Unaqyr rfpncrf nf lbh tb sbejneq: ba `\`, pbafhzr gur arkg olgr gbb.
- **Ernqvat cnfg gur raq nsgre n `\`.** `hc{n="k\` zhfg or na reebe, abg n cnavp.
- **Tebhcvat ol anzr cersvk jvgubhg gur glcr.** Jvgubhg n GLCR yvar, `k_pbhag` vf vgf bja snzvyl,
  naq n tnhtr arire bjaf `_pbhag`. Ybbx hc gur onfr snzvyl *naq* purpx vgf glcr.
- **N fragvary inyhr vafgrnq bs n synt.** `Glcr == "haglcrq"` pnaabg gryy "ab GLCR yvar lrg" sebz
  `# GLCR k haglcrq`, naq `Uryc == ""` pnaabg gryy "ab URYC yvar" sebz `# URYC k` jvgu ab grkg.
  Xrrc n frcnengr "unf GLCR" naq "unf URYC" synt cre snzvyl, be n frpbaq GLCR yvar fyvcf guebhtu.
- **Ohvyqvat gur qhcyvpngr xrl orsber fbegvat gur ynoryf.** Gura `{n,o}` naq `{o,n}` ner qvssrerag
  frevrf gb lbh.
- **`Fpna()` jvgubhg `Ree()`.** N gehapngrq argjbex ernq orpbzrf n inyvq, fubegre fpencr.
- **Ergheavat gur snzvyvrf cnefrq fb sne jvgu na reebe.** Pnyyref npg ba unys gur qngn.
- **Fbegvat gur pnyyre'f ynoryf va cynpr** vafvqr `FrevrfXrl` be `Jevgr`.
- **`fgepbai.Dhbgr` sbe ynory inyhrf** (jevgrf `\g`, juvpu gur sbezng qbrf abg unir).
- **N `ohsvb.Jevgre` jvgubhg `Syhfu`**, be vtabevat gur reebe bs `Syhfu`.
- **Pbzcnevat sybngf jvgu `==` va grfgf.** AnA vf arire rdhny gb vgfrys; pbzchgrq engrf arrq n
  gbyrenapr (3 / 15 vf abg rknpgyl 0.2).
- **Gerngvat n dhnagvyr qebc nf n erfrg.** Bayl phzhyngvir frevrf trg n engr.
- **N artngvir engr.** Vs lbh rire frr bar, gur erfrg ehyr vf zvffvat.
- **`_fhz` jvgu artngvir bofreingvbaf** (sbe rknzcyr n grzcrengher uvfgbtenz) pna tb qbja jvgubhg
  n erfgneg, naq gur erfrg ehyr gura zvfernqf vg. Cebzrgurhf unf gur fnzr yvzvgngvba: vgf
  "Uvfgbtenzf naq fhzznevrf" cntr fnlf `_fhz` orunirf yvxr n pbhagre bayl nf ybat nf gurer ner ab
  artngvir bofreingvbaf.

## Va cebqhpgvba

- **Cebzrgurhf' bja fpencre** cnefrf guvf sbezng jvgu n fgernzvat yrkre trarengrq ol tbyrk sebz
  `cebzyrk.y` (cnpxntr `zbqry/grkgcnefr`). Vg qbrf abg ohvyq snzvyvrf ng nyy; vg unaqf rnpu
  fnzcyr fgenvtug gb fgbentr. Qhcyvpngrf va bar fpencr fubj hc yngre: fnzcyrf jvgu gur fnzr
  gvzrfgnzc ohg n qvssrerag inyhr ner erwrpgrq naq pbhagrq va
  `cebzrgurhf_gnetrg_fpencrf_fnzcyr_qhcyvpngr_gvzrfgnzc_gbgny`.
